Capture destination frames when a mouse drop empties the source space.

Base: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/commit/dd845723416f5fe92af49fad5ebab00369e07edd
Source: https://github.com/asmvik/yabai/issues/2817

An empty source returns NULL, which can equal the destination root's parent.
Capture the destination when no source node was captured, while preserving
duplicate capture suppression when a source node exists.

--- a/src/mouse_handler.c
+++ b/src/mouse_handler.c
@@ -188,3 +188,3 @@
-    if (src_node_rm != src_node_add && src_node_rm != src_node_add->parent) {
+    if (!src_node_rm || (src_node_rm != src_node_add && src_node_rm != src_node_add->parent)) {
         window_node_capture_windows(src_node_add, &window_list);
     }
